id: poisonous
name: Poisonous
kind: battlefield
envQuality: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Poison in the air or the ground. End your turn in it and you are Poisoned.
text: >
  Poisonous: If you end your Turn in this Battle Environment, gain the Poisoned Combat
  Condition.

---

# The end of your turn alone, and no clock: the entry gives none, so the Poisoned stays
# until something takes it off. Which is the difference between this and Electrified's
# Impediment - that one lifts on its own, and this one is a thing you have to deal with.
#
# It does nothing to a character who cannot be Poisoned. Unnatural forbids it, and
# `setCondition` refuses an immunity out loud rather than silently - so an Unnatural
# character walking through poison is told nothing happened, which is the right answer and
# a visible one.

[automatic/end-of-turn]
gain(poisoned);
